@bank all
// Pillar 5 (head writer, seat W): "What's next" (seat C's worksNext, 24.4). One true sentence, shown on the Record and
// the Training tab. next.<id>: the next row that hasn't opened (what's coming). next.wait.<id>: it's open, go and
// find them. next.band.<band>: nothing new ahead in this rank yet. TEXTS.

== next.m1
- Torres wants to show you his round.
== next.wait.m1
- Torres is waiting to show you his round. Find him.
== next.m4
- Yara Esposito could use a hand with the stores.
== next.wait.m4
- Yara has a hauling run for you. Stores, Deck 5.
== next.m3d
- Wednesday at three: the drill. Calder runs it.
== next.wait.m3d
- The drill's on. Calder's waiting.
== next.m5
- Brennan's oven needs a lesson in tuning: Calder will show you.
== next.wait.m5
- Brennan and Calder are waiting for you in the galley.
== next.m3i
- Thursday morning: Tomas will check your bunk. Tidy up.
== next.wait.m3i
- Inspection now. Tomas is on his way.
== next.m7
- Something's coming your way from Torres. A tool.
== next.wait.m7
- Torres left something for you at the board.
== next.p3
- The Chief has a funny one for you soon.
== next.wait.p3
- Calder has a head-scratcher waiting at the board.
== next.m6
- Calder will teach you how to make things safe.
== next.wait.m6
- Calder's waiting to teach you about incidents.
== next.m2
- Your first oily job will earn you a work uniform.
== next.wait.m2
- Torres has something for you to wear. Find him.
== next.t2
- Calder has a test job for you: Tier 2.
== next.band.new
- Keep at it: the board will teach you plenty.
== next.band.steady
- Keep at it: Calder's watching your work.
== next.band.reliable
- People are starting to rely on you. Keep going.
== next.band.trusted
- The real faults come to you first now. Show them why.
== next.band.relied
- Calder relies on you. That's not nothing.

// ---- Pillar 5 Step 3 (head writer W2): the first promotion (C2), team jobs (M2), tracing (M3), P1 and P2 (H2)
== next.wait.t2
- Your test job is on the board. Calder's watching. Take it.
== next.summons
- Calder wants you in her office. Don't keep her waiting.
== next.move
- Tonight you move to cabin 4-23. Calder walks you there at five.
== next.ceremony
- The Captain commissions you at 17:15, Deck 1. Clean uniform.
== next.m8
- Team jobs: big machines, four pairs of hands, yours one of them.
== next.wait.m8
- A team job's posted. Be at your spot when it starts.
== next.m9
- Tracing: a fault that starts somewhere else. Calder, Friday.
== next.wait.m9
- Calder has the pipe kit for you. Go and see her.
== next.p1
- Some faults only show at some times. Calder has one.
== next.wait.p1
- Calder has a head-scratcher. Ask her when it happens.
== next.p2
- Someone saw the fault and you didn't. Tomas has an idea.
== next.wait.p2
- Find Tomas. He's got a word for you about the scrubber.
